25.360" end="00:25.680"> had</span><span begin="00:25.780" end="00:25.910"> a</span><span begin="00:26.150" end="00:27.650"> breakdown</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.900" end="00:30.370"><span begin="00:27.900" end="00:27.910">A</span><span begin="00:28.130" end="00:28.310"> few</span><span begin="00:28.450" end="00:28.730"> weeks</span><span begin="00:28.820" end="00:30.320"> later</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.370" end="00:33.560"><span begin="00:30.370" end="00:31.200">Somebody</span><span begin="00:31.340" end="00:31.620"> wore</span><span begin="00:31.710" end="00:32.080"> your</span><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:33.560"> perfume</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.560" end="00:37.370"><span begin="00:33.560" end="00:33.790">It</span><span begin="00:33.800" end="00:34.210"> almost</span><span begin="00:34.340" end="00:34.670"> killed</span><span begin="00:34.760" end="00:36.260"> me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.370" end="00:39.770"><span begin="00:37.370" end="00:37.370">I</span><span begin="00:37.550" end="00:37.780"> had</span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:38.020"> to</span><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:38.530"> leave</span><span begin="00:38.570" end="00:38.760"> the</span><span begin="00:38.810" end="00:39.770"> room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.770" end="00:44.130"><span begin="00:39.770" end="00:40.000">It's</span><span begin="00:40.090" end="00:40.370"> just</span><span begin="00:40.510" end="00:42.460"> another</span><span begin="00:42.690" end="00:44.130"> day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.130" end="00:47.300"><span begin="00:44.130" end="00:44.260">And</span><span begin="00:44.300" end="00:44.530"> It's</span><span begin="00:44.570" end="00:44.840"> not</span><span begin="00:44.880" end="00:45.460"> over,</span><span begin="00:46.090" end="00:46.670"> 'til</span><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:47.030"> it's</span><span begin="00:47.070" end="00:47.570"> over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.300" end="00:49.830"><span begin="00:47.300" end="00:47.900">It's</span><span begin="00:48.040" end="00:48.870"> never</span><span begin="00:48.970" end="00:49.830"> over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.830" end="00:54.900"><span begin="00:49.830" end="00:50.200">It's</span><span begin="00:50.240" end="00:50.610"> just</span><span begin="00:50.710" end="00:52.520"> another</span><span begin="00:52.660" end="00:54.160"> day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.900" end="00:58.320"><span begin="00:54.900" end="00:55.080">And</span><span begin="00:55.170" end="00:55.270"> It's</span><span begin="00:55.360" end="00:55.640"> not</span><span begin="00:55.680" end="00:56.610"> over,</span><span begin="00:56.710" end="00:57.080"> 'til</span><span begin="00:57.120" end="00:57.500"> it's</span><span begin="00:57.640" end="00:58.320"> over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.320" end="01:01.430"><span begin="00:58.320" end="00:58.970">It's</span><span begin="00:59.100" end="00:59.890"> never</span><span begin="01:00.030" end="01:01.430"> over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.430" end="01:06.540"><span begin="01:01.430" end="01:01.430">I</span><span begin="01:01.570" end="01:01.940"> don't</span><span begin="01:01.980" end="01:02.260"> look</span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.680"> for</span><span begin="01:02.870" end="01:03.190"> you</span><span begin="01:03.280" end="01:03.520"> on</span><span begin="01:03.660" end="01:03.980"> the</span><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:05.530"> staircase</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.540" end="01:12.940"><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:06.630">Or</span><span begin="01:06.640" end="01:06.950"> wish</span><span begin="01:07.050" end="01:07.370"> you</span><span begin="01:07.420" end="01:08.020"> thought</span><span begin="01:08.110" end="01:08.390"> that</span><span begin="01:08.490" end="01:08.670"> we</span><span begin="01:08.810" end="01:09.040"> were</span><span begin="01:09.090" end=